From: Le Hoang Quyen <lehoangquyen@chromium.org>
Date: Thu, 17 Sep 2026 17:18:13 +0800
Subject: D3D11: Fix InputLayoutCache key for disabled and multiview attributes

In InputLayoutCache::getInputLayout, the divisor recorded in the
cache key did not account for whether the attribute is enabled, nor
did it use the overflow-safe multiview divisor helper:

1. When an attribute is disabled, D3D11 uses current-value data which
is always stored and fetched with divisor 0 (per-vertex). Recording the
binding's non-zero divisor in the cache key caused collisions with
enabled attributes.
2. In multiview rendering, calculating the cache key divisor via
wrapping 32-bit arithmetic could wrap to 0 (e.g. 0x80000000 * 2),
while VertexArray11 clamped to UINT_MAX via
GetMultiviewAdjustedDivisor.

This change uses GetMultiviewAdjustedDivisor and sets the divisor to 0
for disabled attributes in the cache key.

Bug: chromium:560423758
Bug: chromium:556505644
Change-Id: I0e256bb80d8e9588236be20e001271d9d0698b62
Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/angle/angle/+/8425179
Reviewed-by: Geoff Lang <geofflang@chromium.org>
Reviewed-by: Shahbaz Youssefi <syoussefi@chromium.org>
Commit-Queue: Quyen Le <lehoangquyen@google.com>
Auto-Submit: Quyen Le <lehoangquyen@google.com>

diff --git a/src/libANGLE/renderer/d3d/d3d11/InputLayoutCache.cpp b/src/libANGLE/renderer/d3d/d3d11/InputLayoutCache.cpp
index 3795eb440566ea8bb94b736421710ee21efdd42d..a3607da8692eef2654beb9d3a06decc391b2545f 100644
--- a/src/libANGLE/renderer/d3d/d3d11/InputLayoutCache.cpp
+++ b/src/libANGLE/renderer/d3d/d3d11/InputLayoutCache.cpp
@@ -24,6 +24,7 @@
 #include "libANGLE/renderer/d3d/d3d11/ShaderExecutable11.h"
 #include "libANGLE/renderer/d3d/d3d11/VertexArray11.h"
 #include "libANGLE/renderer/d3d/d3d11/formatutils11.h"
+#include "libANGLE/renderer/renderer_utils.h"
 
 namespace rx
 {
@@ -127,7 +128,7 @@ angle::Result InputLayoutCache::getInputLayout(
     const auto &attribs            = state.getVertexArray()->getVertexAttributes();
     const auto &bindings           = state.getVertexArray()->getVertexBindings();
     const auto &locationToSemantic = executableD3D->getAttribLocationToD3DSemantics();
-    int divisorMultiplier          = executable->usesMultiview() ? executable->getNumViews() : 1;
+    int numViews = executable->usesMultiview() ? executable->getNumViews() : 1;
 
     for (size_t attribIndex : executable->getActiveAttribLocationsMask())
     {
@@ -143,8 +144,13 @@ angle::Result InputLayoutCache::getInputLayout(
             state.getVertexAttribCurrentValue(static_cast<unsigned int>(attribIndex));
         angle::FormatID vertexFormatID = gl::GetVertexFormatID(attrib, currentValue.Type);
 
-        layout.addAttributeData(glslElementType, d3dSemantic, vertexFormatID,
-                                binding.getDivisor() * divisorMultiplier);
+        // Disabled attributes use current-value data, which is stored and fetched with divisor 0
+        // (per-vertex). Using divisor 0 here prevents cache key collisions with enabled attributes
+        // whose binding has a non-zero divisor.
+        GLuint divisor =
+            attrib.enabled ? GetMultiviewAdjustedDivisor(numViews, binding.getDivisor()) : 0;
+
+        layout.addAttributeData(glslElementType, d3dSemantic, vertexFormatID, divisor);
     }
 
     if (layout.numAttributes > 0)
diff --git a/src/tests/gl_tests/TransformFeedbackTest.cpp b/src/tests/gl_tests/TransformFeedbackTest.cpp
index d638786adbb69ee011bd6917e7bedd9874f961f7..243322c931c3b59f787aa3d6ffb166e4ce6e74b3 100644
--- a/src/tests/gl_tests/TransformFeedbackTest.cpp
